---
{
  "layout": "layout.njk",
  "permalink": "festivals.html",
  "title": "Festivals & living traditions · Sanatan Heritage",
  "description": "Explore Hindu festivals, temple celebrations and recurring vratas through a searchable directory with source references and regional context.",
  "bodyClass": "references-page heritage-journal-page",
  "ogType": "website",
  "ogImage": "og.png",
  "ogImageAlt": "Sanatan Heritage — Stories, Wisdom, Traditions",
  "noindex": false,
  "search": false,
  "story": false,
  "scripts": ["/assets/js/festivals.js"],
  "sourceLink": "sources.html#festivals"
}
---
<main id="main" data-pagefind-body>
  <section class="reference-intro" id="top">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Festivals</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">THE LIVING TRADITIONS JOURNAL</p>
    <h1>Stories remembered.<br><em>Traditions lived.</em></h1>
    <p>Prayer, music, storytelling and shared celebration bring sacred narratives into community life. Explore {{ festivals.length }} festivals and observances through their meanings, stories and traditions. Open any entry to read its fuller context.</p>
    <nav class="journal-index" aria-label="Festival shortcuts"><a href="#festival-directory">Browse all {{ festivals.length }} entries</a><a href="#shivaratri">Maha Shivaratri</a><a href="#navaratri">Navaratri</a><a href="#hanuman-jayanti">Hanuman Jayanti</a></nav>
  </section>
  <section class="section festival-directory-section" id="festival-directory" aria-labelledby="festival-directory-title">
    <div class="festival-directory-intro"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE SACRED CALENDAR</p><h2 id="festival-directory-title">Festivals, journeys<br><em>and observances.</em></h2><p>Find a celebration, then explore its meaning, observances and textual setting in the same entry. Lunar dates and practices vary between traditions.</p></div>
    <form class="festival-filters" data-festival-form role="search" aria-label="Filter the festival directory" hidden><label for="festival-query">Find a festival<input id="festival-query" type="search" maxlength="200" placeholder="Search by name, deity or theme"></label><label for="festival-kind">Kind of observance<select id="festival-kind"><option value="all">All entries</option><option value="festival">Festivals</option><option value="temple">Temple celebrations</option><option value="observance">Vratas &amp; recurring observances</option></select></label><button type="reset">Reset filters</button></form>
    <p class="festival-count" id="festival-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{ festivals.length }} calendar entries</p>
    <div class="festival-directory">{% for festival in festivals %}<article class="festival-entry" id="calendar-{{ festival.id }}" data-festival-entry data-kind="{{ festival.kind }}" data-keywords="{{ festival.keywords }}"><p class="eyebrow">{{ festival.label }}</p><h3{% if festival.legacyAnchor %} id="{{ festival.legacyAnchor }}"{% endif %}>{{ festival.title }}</h3><p>{{ festival.summary }}</p>{% if festival.timing %}<p class="festival-timing"><strong>In this account:</strong> {{ festival.timing }}</p>{% endif %}<details class="festival-details"><summary aria-label="Read more about {{ festival.title }}">Read more<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="festival-detail-body">{% if festival.detailTemplate %}{% include festival.detailTemplate %}{% else %}{% for detail in festival.details %}<section><h4>{{ detail.heading }}</h4><p>{{ detail.text }}</p></section>{% endfor %}{% endif %}</div></details><a class="festival-source" href="{{ festival.source }}">Text &amp; context →</a></article>{% endfor %}</div>
    <div class="festival-empty" id="festival-empty" hidden><h3>No matching entries</h3><p>Try another name or clear the filters.</p><button type="button" data-festival-reset>Show all entries</button></div>
    <noscript><p>All entries are available below. Search and filters are optional browser enhancements.</p></noscript>
  </section>
  <section class="deity-next"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW THE CONNECTIONS</p><h2>From celebration<br><em>to sacred story.</em></h2><div><a href="/stories.html">Explore the story collection</a><a href="/places.html">Visit the sacred places journal</a><a href="/sources.html#festivals">Explore the references</a></div></section>
</main>
